  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Basic Sciences, Engineering and STEM Education Capacities for Inno</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This workplan supports Member States in strengthening capacities in basic sciences, engineering, and STEM education to foster innovation, entrepreneurship, and science-driven sustainable development. Through the revitalization of the International Basic Sciences Programme (IBSP), expansion of remote laboratory access, promotion of engineering capacity development, and support for innovation ecosystems, UNESCO will enhance scientific infrastructure, improve STEM education systems, and strengthen opportunities for youth and women in science, technology, engineering, and mathematics. The programme contributes directly to the International Decade of Sciences for Sustainable Development (IDSSD) and advances UNESCO&apos;s Global Priorities for Africa and Gender Equality.</narrative>
  </description>
